Used only by poc/stbi-shim.c (built by poc/build-stbi.sh into libstbi.so) for the
formats poc/image.lisp does not decode in Lisp: JPEG (baseline + progressive), PSD,
HDR, PIC. See doc/previews.org, "Why stb_image for JPEG".
